 adjudicó el 12 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 10 % de todos sus contratos de obras. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 15 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 39.753,30 euros, se adjudicó en noviembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: El hecho de que se adjudiquen contratos cerca del límite no indica que haya sido un error o que se haya actuado mal. Puede deberse a razones legítimas como precios de mercado o necesidades específicas.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1], [2], [3] atienden la misma necesidad. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en distintas áreas. Analizar si los contratos adjudicados en diciembre se relacionan con un aumento de necesidades en ese mes.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 24 minor contracts for works above 37,500 and up to 40,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 6.4 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 3.8, with a 95% confidence interval of 2.1 to 6.6. December accounts for 12% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 10% of all its works contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 4. Contract [1], for 39,753.30 euros, was awarded in November 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The data shows a pattern of contracts just under the limit, but it doesn't prove any wrongdoing. Prices may be set by market conditions or budget constraints, and the numbers alone don't indicate improper actions.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and amounts of the contracts to see if they align with the body's needs. Review awardee A's contracts to see if they repeat the same type of work. Look at the distribution of contracts across different months to identify any unusual trends.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"obras","citas":["lfZB4yHpxFGTylGzYmBF9Q%3D%3D","aWo7oOeJpmx4zIRvjBVCSw%3D%3D","N7zovVoZYg56nTs9LZ9RhQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}